<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Týřov–Skryje–Skryjská jezírka — Týřov–Skryje–Skryjská jezírka</name><desc>Walk from Týřovice bus stop to the Berounka bridge and take the forest spur up to Týřov castle ruins. Return from the ruin and continue through Skryje, then descend to Mlýn Slapnice and follow Zbirožský potok to Skryjská jezírka. Retrace the gorge spur and finish in Skryje on the blue-marked return trail; check the separate outward and return bus services.

